From: LxnChan <lingxuanning@outlook.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ntdll: attach loaded win32u before ARM64EC GUI dependency cycles

SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later

The iDeck PE farm promotes delay imports to eager imports. A GUI cycle
can initialize comctl32 while gdi32/user32 are still in progress, before
their win32u dependency is attached. Its first NtGdiCreateBitmap then
branches through a NULL __wine_syscall_dispatcher.

After kernel32 bootstrap, attach an already loaded win32u before walking
other nodes. Keep loader locking, recursion guards, pinning, activation
contexts and failure propagation in process_attach. Other architectures
and processes without win32u retain their existing attach order.

--- a/dlls/ntdll/loader.c
+++ b/dlls/ntdll/loader.c
@@ -2224,8 +2224,27 @@
     if (lpReserved) wm->ldr.LoadCount = -1;  /* pin it if imported by the main exe */
     if (wm->ldr.ActivationContext) RtlActivateActivationContext( 0, wm->ldr.ActivationContext, &cookie );

+#ifdef __arm64ec__
+    /* The PE farm promotes delay imports to ordinary imports to avoid x64
+     * delay thunks in the ARM64EC JIT copy. The resulting GUI dependency
+     * cycles can reach comctl32's DllMain before win32u's DllMain has set
+     * __wine_syscall_dispatcher. Initialize this ntdll-only leaf first.
+     * Do not load it into headless processes or attach it during emulator /
+     * kernel32 bootstrap. The current node is already marked in progress,
+     * so reentrant attaches keep the normal cycle protection. */
+    if (imports_fixup_done)
+    {
+        WINE_MODREF *kernel32 = find_basename_module( L"kernel32.dll" );
+        WINE_MODREF *win32u = find_basename_module( L"win32u.dll" );
+
+        if (kernel32 && (kernel32->ldr.Flags & LDR_PROCESS_ATTACHED) && win32u && win32u != wm)
+            status = process_attach( win32u->ldr.DdagNode, lpReserved );
+    }
+#endif
+
     /* Recursively attach all DLLs this one depends on */
-    status = walk_node_dependencies( node, lpReserved, process_attach );
+    if (status == STATUS_SUCCESS)
+        status = walk_node_dependencies( node, lpReserved, process_attach );

     if (!wm->ldr.InInitializationOrderLinks.Flink)
         InsertTailList(&NtCurrentTeb()->Peb->LdrData->InInitializationOrderModuleList,
